    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725090/extras/97e246b193c8f4c696c3459d2edcba75.avif?t=1753272024\" data-has-big width=800 height=196 /></span><strong>Hello Everyone!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am <strong>The Game Developer</strong> of this game, and let me just tell you a few things about it. It is a <strong>First Person Shooter</strong> with <strong>Bombastic Action</strong>, <strong>High-Scale Set Pieces</strong>, <strong>Fun Shooting Mechanics</strong>, along with a <strong>Deeply Layered Story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you leave to check out my amazing game, I would just like to shout-out my <strong>Game Manager (#2694)</strong> \u2014 without him, this game wouldn't have been possible and wouldn't be nearly as good as it turned out to be. In my humble opinion, he deserves all the praise and respect in the world. He's the <strong>MOST competent Game Manager I know</strong>, and I would give him my highest recommendation to anyone. He is open to the possibility of joining other projects and collaborating with other Game Developers, preferably Gaming Auteurs.<br><i>(Note: will not work for exposure)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My game is completely <strong>bug-free</strong> and has <strong>no glitches at all,</strong>\u00a0so as the Game Creator of my game, all I can say is Enjoy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong><br>This project is yet to be approved by the Game Managers' Association.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725090/extras/f38d6692d9e3c1bf533f2d38ef650c96.avif?t=1753272024\" data-has-big width=800 height=196 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter gameplay with bombastic action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-scale cinematic set pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and engaging shooting mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeply layered story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug-free and glitch-free experience</p></li></ul>",
